<h2>What Is Harness Engineering?</h2>
<p>In one line, it is <strong>"designing the system in which AI works"</strong>. It started from the discovery that even with the same AI model, the quality of the result is completely different depending on <strong>how you compose the environment (the harness) surrounding that model</strong>.</p>

